OL,4,CRussia reports 500,000 war deaths    W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GAt least 490,334 Russian soldiers    W5
OL,7,Ghave died since the start of the war W5
OL,8,Gin Ukraine in 2022, according to     W5
OL,9,GRussian government statistics        W5
OL,10,Ganalysed by the BBC.                 W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GThe leaked Rosstat data reveal how   W5
OL,13,Gthe full-scale invasion of Ukraine   W5
OL,14,Ghas fundamentally changed mortality  W5
OL,15,Gpatterns in Russia, and show the     W5
OL,16,Ghigh cost paid in human life in a    W5
OL,17,Gwar that Vladimir Putin had assumed  W5
OL,18,Gwould last only days but is now      W5
OL,19,Galmost five years old.               W5
